@startuml
actor Officer as "Port Authority Officer"
participant "Port System" as System
participant "Notification Service" as Notification

Officer -> System : Submit organization and representative data
System -> System : Validate organization and representative info
alt Valid data
    System -> System : Register organization and representative
    System -> Notification : Send notification to representative (email/phone)
    Notification -> Officer : Confirmation of registration
else Invalid data
    System -> Officer : Error message (missing/invalid info)
end
@enduml